consensus_and_smartgen_agents.logical_chain_json_format_instruction:
Reply with JSON only, in this shape, so the app can show it:
{"chains": {"R1": 0, "R2": 0}}
chains: each response's total logical chains (explicit + implicit). The consensus summary's line is filled in where the two consensus agents' results meet: the max length chain of all its members.

